messages "Torspo\n**\nSubj: Eqtour\n\nDate: Oct  1\n\n13.10.(pe)-15.10.(su) valisena aikana vois tehaa kalaa ja suffelia \nTarkotuksena olis etta kasais 2deffuu, 2blasuu ja 2hiilua\npienemmalla joukolla en jaksa vaivautua ja seuraava vaihtoehto olis sit 9party johon ei jengi\ntod. nak. riita\nEli mulle mailia jokatapauksessa etta tuletko vai etka niin informoin jossain valissa\netta onnistuneeko jne.\nJos porukka saadaan kasaan ja pitaa ruveta karsimaan vakea niin se, etta osaa pelata, lasketaan\ntarkeammaksi kun ekspan maara\nEli jos karsiudut niin ota se rakentavana kritiikkina ja opettele pelaamaan\n -love: Torspo\n\nKirka on ihana\n\n**\nRehti\n**\nSubj: kilta\n\nDate: Oct 18\n\nElikkarcheri ei melee damalla hurraa, mutta skilli ja mahdollisuus kouluttaa elukka\ntekee siita mahdollisen soolottajan mutta connia ei paljoa heru niin archeri kuuluu\ntakariviin naputtamaan.\n\nJos Kiltoja olis kaks ja yhessa 30lvl eli 60lvl max..\nKillat:\nApprentice Archers 30lvl (ehkapa kiltaan paasemiseksi pitais olla vaikka veteraanit\n  levelilla 10 joka tekis siita aika haippa guildin..tai rangerit)\nMaster Archers 30lvl (vaatimus: apprentice archerit tapissa)\n\nBowit:\nshort bow,long bow,battle bow (jne...ehkapa myos crossbowit)\n\nSkillej\nArchery = bowin kadessa pito taito..joka bowilla tietty vaatimus...leveli vaatimukset\nvaatii greattiin ottaan jossain vaiheessa. easy,  levelilla (1-15)\nShoot Arrow = offu skilli, joka tekee damaa ja vie yhden nuolen. complicated. epcosti 3%, \nlevelilla (10-25) (voisi keskeytya tarpeeksi kovasta iskusta)\nCreate Arrow = Tekee skillin % riippuen 1-10 nuolta. epcosti 0.5%, very easy, levelilla\n(10-30),aika vaikka 3 runia\nHawk Eye = Critti mastery skillille Shoot Arrow, automatikki, very hard, levelilla (55-60)\nExtended Pull = +dama mastery skillille Shoot Arrow automatikki,very hard, levelilla (55-60)\nSteady Hand = attack skilli Shoot Arrowille/tai +dex. automaticci, easy, levelilla (10-40)\n(Tame Animal) = valmis skilli, levelilla (31-55)\n(Control Animal) = valmis skilli, levelilla (31-55)\n(Camping) = valmis skilli, levelilla (20-40)\n(Fire Building) = valmis skilli, levelilla (40-50)\n\nTossa nyt ois jotain,.\n\n**\nCeltron\n**\nSubj: protremove\n\nDate: Oct 23\n\nsen spellin pit滗 sitten ottaa ihan kaikki pois p滗lt my鰏 stun resisti\nmy鰏 vulnit pit滗 l鋒tee pois (niitvoi sitten olla enemm鋘 kuin yksi!).\n\ntoi on ihan toimiva ratkaisu, itse olin ajatellut tehdsen hieman erilailla, mutta eiptuossa\nsen kummempaa.\n\nhaluan ettkokeilet viel ettse tosiaankin ottaa kaikki enchantment spellit pois jostain ukosta.\nparempi korjata se ennen peliin pist鋗istkuin vasta sen j鋖keen.\nPS. kirjoita spellille vielspelldescikin.\n\n**\nNtg\n**\nSubj: EQ:t\n\nDate: Nov 28\n\nBlack ring with yellow stones on it X2\nWhite turban\nShining white robes\nBoots of light\n\n**\nJenny\n**\nSubj: Spellej鋅n\nDate: Mar 12\n\nmerchanteile olis hyvsaada sellanen spelli milln鋕is % lukeman paljon mosulla on Hpta j鋖jell helpottas arviointii onko mosa tapettavis etc, sit Abjut vois saada sellasen milln鋕is mitprotteja targetissa on...ihan k鋞evsekin equtuksessa ei tarviis arvailla miton viel p滗l ja mitei...sit joku haste ois iha kiva mageille miknostas pikkasen hp ja sp ja ep regeneittjsp...muissakin mudeis k鋝itt滗kseni jotain tollasia...sit siihen poisoniin, Poison sana ois hyvjos sen vois clerutki sit oppia ja sitsanaa hy鰀ynt鋏n castaa poison removee ja abjuile sama kans ne vois pist滗 pientresistii poisonii vastaa et pystyt savee poisonaamisen ettei se tuliskaan...sit se boltti ja strm vois olla niiku normi boltitki on mut sit sillpystys castaa Cre lopputavul esim sen \"poison\" jutun et tippus sithpta sillee v鋖il pikkase...mut vain 1 poison vois olla kerral p滗l ettei sitvois chainaa iha tajuttomia\n\n**\nRimber\n**\nSubj: BUgi\n\nDate: Mar 26\n\nYou take a pile of gray bones from the ground.\nYou start fleeing from the battle.\nA promontory reaching over a frozen pond (w,cave)\nAn adult polar bear is looking after its offspring\nA baby polar bear is playing around in here\nA baby polar bear is playing around in here\nA huge underground opening (n,s,e)\nA baby polar bear is playing around in here\nA baby polar bear is playing around in here\nOn a frozen pond (n,s,w,e,nw,ne)\nAn ice golem\nYou start slippering onwards on the icy surface.\nOn a frozen pond (n,s,w,e,sw,se)\nAn ice golem\nYou start slippering onwards on the icy surface.\nA snowy shore of a frozen pond (s,e,se,enter)\nA growling guard dog, chained to an igloo\nA spacious igloo made of frozen snow (out)\nGordon, the banished snow Dwarf                              \nYou give A pile of gray bones to Gordon.\nGordon says: 'Absolutely brilliant thinking, my friend! I will go light\n              these right ahead. You can join with me if you like. Meet\n              me at the campfire just outside my igloo.\nGordon arrives from enter.\nThe icy pond ends into a small strip of snowy land. From north and west\nthe strip is bordered with sturdy and frozen-looking snowy walls. The\nceiling, where can be seen some icicles, is pitched towards the frozen\nwall in north. By the northern wall, almost touching the ceiling, can\nbe seen an igloo. The doorway is blocked with a planket, but the igloo\n\ncan still be entered without any troubles. Near the doorway seems to be\na small campfire.\n    There are four obvious exits: south, east, southeast and enter\nGordon, the banished snow Dwarf\nGordon places all bones in a nice pile inside the circle of icy rocks.\nGordon smiles as he looks at his work of art.\nGordon starts skillfully rub two of the bones against each other.\nVery thin smoke starts rising from the two bones.\nGordon manages to light a small fire with the bones.\nGordon seems very confident as the flames in the campfire start to grow.\n\nGordon says: 'Ah, I did it! I think I just sit here for a moment and watch the $\nYou take a brass tea pan.\nA dark igloo made of frozen snow (out)\nDooris, the banished snow Dwarf female\nDooris says dreamily: 'I think I'm in love with my neighbor, Gordon.'\nYou give A brass tea pan to Dooris.\nDooris says: 'How wonderful! Wait a moment while I drink this.'\nDooris takes a tiny gulp of tea and smiles dreamily.\nLooks like Dooris would be in heaven when drinking from the pan.\nDooris tips the tea pan and takes a short peek inside of it.\n\nA wonderful scent spreads in the igloo from the open tea pan.\nDooris tips the tea pan and takes a short peek inside of it.\nDooris takes a tiny gulp of tea and smiles dreamily.\nLooks like Dooris would be in heaven when drinking from the pan.\nDooris licks her lips while not drinking the tea.\nDooris says: 'Oh, that was maybe the best tea moment in my life.'\nDooris says: 'Now let's return this tea pan back to its original place.\n              I'll follow you for that time.\nA snowy shore of a frozen pond (s,w,sw,enter)\nDooris arrives after Rimber.\n\nA snowy shore of a frozen pond (s,e,se,enter)\nGordon, the banished snow Dwarf\nDooris arrives after Rimber.\nDooris hangs the tea pan back to its original place above the fireplace.\nGordon looks at Dooris.\nDooris says: 'I don't know actually why, but I think I'll stay here for a while.\nDooris smiles mysteriously at Gordon.\nGordon winks meaningfully at Dooris.\nDooris whispers something to Gordon.\nGordon giggles inanely.\n\nGordon whispers something to Dooris.\nDooris blushes in bright red.\nGordon pulls Dooris in his arms and gives her a long, passionate kiss.\nDooris stares dreamingly at Gordon.\nGordon winks behind his shoulders.\nGordon leaves in enter.\nYour sensitive mind notices a wrongness in the fabric of space.\n\n\n**\nOzmolokki\n**\nSubj: NECROT\n\nDate: Apr 25\n\nNecrojen bugit k鋗mit yms.\n\nhorde ei tee ollenkaan melee damaa. vain outrageous powerilla ja jos hordesta kuolee\nmosa niin lichi muistaa castata yhden boltin muuten horde ei sitten damagea teekk滗n\n\nhorde ei p滗se cityyn ellei tapa niitguardeja gateilta\n\nhorde ei tule banditeille vaan menee jonnekkin perseeseen eli banditeista pit鋓s selvityksin.\nyleiston etthorde h鋠i滗 jos tulee banditti vastaan\n\nenchantmentit tippuu minkkerkee vaikka skillit onkin melkein tapissa\n\nhorde j滗 jumiin hautausmalle misssijaitsee necro kiltakin\n\njos soul drainaa mosaa se hy鰇k滗 samantien kimppuun eikhorde ole edessjohtaa yleenskuolemaan\n\nhorde ei suostu melkein mill滗n pist鋗滗n mit滗n p滗llensesim aseita\n\n\nsais joku edes noi bugit korjattua niin tossa killassa olis jotai j鋜ke!\n\n**\nJenny\n**\nSubj: herba\n\nDate: May 19\n\njoo voin tulla\n\n**\nGolthar\n**\nSubj: herbalists\n\nDate: May 20\n\nmulla olis kylla kiinnostusta tohon herpatesteriksi...\n\n**\nCeles\n**\nSubj: Herba Testeri\n\nDate: May 20\n\nhaluu testeriks pliis jooko\n\n**\nOzmolokki\n**\nSubj: herbalists\n\nDate: May 20\n\nno koska mtunnen t鋘 mudin niinku omat taskuni =) ja pelaan aktiivisesti y鰐鋚鋓v滗\nparempaa testerii ei voi l鰕t滗 ku m鋅nsent滗 testasin torchit yms just eile kuntoon vai olikos edellisp鋓v鋘tms\n\n**\nOaycrin\n**\nSubj: lost eq in mud crash\n\nCc: **\nDate: May 27\n\nHello, i lost all eq i the mudkrash and talked to veron, he told me to send a list of the eq i lost to an archwiz so here it is.\nBluish ring {dim blue glow}, Ring of Leb-Kamar {dim blue glow),Royal crown of the Kingship {dim blue glow}, \nWooden medallion {blue glow}, Cloak made from wolf fur {blue glow}, A Steel plate mail {bright white glow}, \nSteel bracers with bone decorations {blue glow}, Shining steel chain gauntlets {dim blue glow}, Coral belt {dim blue glow},  \nSteel leggings {dim blue glow, Ranger boots of Forestry (blue glow) and 2x Silverblue steel great axe.\nthat was all.\n/Oaycrin\n\n**\nCeles\n**\nSubj: EKUT!\n\nDate: May 27\n\n2 x silverblue steel great axe, 2 x Silvered ring of 'Angel Falls' <dim blue glow>,A shining white divine mithril scale mail bright blue glow,Steel bracers with bone decorations blue glow\nSturdy bone gauntlets dim blue glow\nBone scale leggings named 'The Grim Layer' blue glow\nRanger boots of forestry blue glow\nAn ancient belt with a silver buckle blue glow\nA cloak made of strange substance dim blue glow\nA wooden medallion blue glow\nRed crown blue glow\n\n**\nGolthar\n**\nSubj: ekut\n\nDate: Jun  9\n\nFinger: An ebon ring <bright magenta glow>\nFinger: An ebon ring <bright magenta glow>\nHead: A tattered mage hat 'Painful Dream' <bright magenta glow>\nNeck: Sparkling necklace of pearls <bright magenta glow>\nCloak: A dark cloak with red runes <magenta glow>\nArms: Burning steel bracers <magenta glow>\nHands: A fine pair of silvered gloves <magenta glow>\nBelt: A thin black belt <bright magenta glow>\nTorso: A white leather coat <bright white glow>\nLegs: Leggings of the everlasting Fraternity <magenta glow>\nFeet: Glowing sandals of Kralmakh <bright magenta glow>\nNecklace: The shining necklace of Realm's Guardian <white glow>\n\n**\nCeltron\n**\nSubj: killat\n\nDate: Jun 20\n\nKAIKKI kiltakoodifilet tulee olla /guilds dirikassa\n\nkysytt鋠滗?\n\n\n**\nGolthar\n**\nSubj: lista\n\nDate: Jun 22\n\nFinger: An ebon ring <bright magenta glow>\nFinger: An ebon ring <bright magenta glow>\nHead: A tattered mage hat 'Painful Dream' <bright magenta glow>\nNeck: Sparkling necklace of pearls <bright magenta glow>\nCloak: A dark cloak with red runes <magenta glow>\nArms: Burning steel bracers <magenta glow>\nHands: A fine pair of silvered gloves <magenta glow>\nBelt: A thin black belt <bright magenta glow>\nTorso: A white leather coat <bright white glow>\nLegs: Leggings of the everlasting Fraternity <magenta glow>\nFeet: Glowing sandals of Kralmakh <bright magenta glow>\n\n**\nCeltron\n**\nSubj: stunob\n\nDate: Jun 24\n\nkorjasin sieltmuutamia bugeja.\n\n**\nCeltron\n**\nSubj: monsujen use skillit\n\nDate: Jun 24\n\nmonsut tekee niitniin usein kun miten se chance on definoitu.\neli sitskill_chancee pit滗 laskee jos meinaa, ettse ei alota\nuutta skilliheti.\n\n**\nCeltron\n**\nSubj: library\n\nDate: Jun 24\n\njoo pistne necrojen spellihelpit vaan sinne.\n\n**\nDrakhor\n**\nSubj: Necrojen doo nee maa -spelli\n\nDate: Jun 25\n\nEli otsikon spelli (monen skeletonin samanaikainen hordeen lis滗minen) ei tarkista\nonko jo saavutettu skeletoneissa 30:n kappaleen maksimiraja. Eli tuohon saa kohta-\nlaisen monta kappaletta noita lis鋞tyjos vaan mielenkiintoa riitt滗.\n\n\n**\nWalla\n**\nSubj: rankit\n\nCc: walla\nDate: Jun 28\n\ninitiate\nneophyte\nspiritualist\nsybil\nconjureress\nmystic\nenchantress\nsorceress\nwitch\nwitch 10-19th level\ntopaz witch\nsapphire witch\nruby witch\nemerald witch\ndiamond witch\nwitch mother\nwitch priestess\nhigh priestess\neternal priestess\nprincess of witches\nqueen of witches\n\n**\nCeltron\n**\nSubj: necrot\n\nDate: Jun 28\n\nGirion (/guilds/library/mainhall, Mon Jun 24 16:58:00 2002):\nseems like 'summon undead horde' bugs, tried to summon it. it said that i couldnt add more undead of that type, and then, when i tried to go and fetch it in\nthe western gate it was gone\n\nGirion (/wizards/walla/area/ujar4, Mon Jun 24 18:06:07 2002):\nmy horde havent been in a fight but is still 'about to die'\n\nGirion (/room/out/hills#28739, Mon Jun 24 18:59:09 2002):\nits impossible to recall the horde after an ambush\n\nGirion (/room/out/hills#28739, Mon Jun 24 18:59:23 2002):\nits impossible to summon the horde after an ambush\n\nDrakhor (/wizards/bulut/forest/forest11, Tue Jun 25 22:18:15 2002):\nNecrojen 'doo nee maa' -spelli (monta skeletonia hordeen yhdelltaialla) ei tarkista ollaanko ylitetty jo skeletonien maksimim滗r Nytkin on 50+ skeletonia\nhordessa.\n\n\n**\nCeltron\n**\nSubj: palautetta\n\nDate: Jun 28\n\n[14:04] Tekari tells you 'harmi vaan ettei n鋓lltee mit滗n, vaikka pelaiski.'\n[14:05] Tekari tells you 'kummallakaan n鋓stkilloista. Psi on hieno kilta, mut ei t鋘 kokosena silloikein oo en滗 k鋣tt鲣.'\n[14:05] Tekari tells you 'ei pysty ees pkillaamaa ;)'\n[14:05] Rehti tells you 'huomasin just kuinka suffa se on ku laitoin tota hipsua lisaa....wissu hiili ei enaa riita :)....ohops heitanpa true healin ja \ntapissa yhesta ilma mitaan masterya :)'\n[14:05] Tekari tells you 'mut witcheille en kyl pysty nykyisell滗n keksim滗n mit滗n k鋣tt鲣.'\n[14:05] Tekari tells you 'Liian pienet efektit niillpotikoilla siihen vaivaan n鋒den'\n[14:06] Tekari tells you 'Siinon se joku ns. masteryskilli, joka pit鋓s nousta. mut se on niiiin hidasta se nousu et enptied'\n[14:09] Tekari tells you 'jeh.'\n[14:09] Tekari tells you 'Ja t滗 itse skilli on niin hidas k鋣tt滗, etttodella hitaaks muuttuu sen masteryn nousu jo alkuvaiheessa\n\n..jutellaan vaiheessa.\n\n**\nCeltron\n**\nSubj: psi\n\nDate: Jul 16\n\nJul 16 09:42 [rimber] (env:/wizards/grathlek/area1/eroom2) [cmd:use confuse at paladin] #Failed to load file.\n, program: guilds/skills/confuse.c, object: guilds/skills/confuse line 89\n\nkorjattu\n\n\n**\nGolthar\n**\nSubj: scrollit\n\nDate: Jul 17\n\nL鋒din t鋝svaan miettim滗n ettoisko mik滗n 'wipe scroll'-tyylinen\nskilli mahdollinen ku noita k鋗mejtossa scrolleja kirjotellessa\ntapahtuu aina v鋖illja sitte sapettaa ku pit滗 kirjotella ne loppuun\nasti ja sitte lukea vasta se scrolli...\nEli se skilli tyhjent鋓s scrollin/poistaa sen kokonaan\n\n**\nCeltron\n**\nSubj: onnea demigodille\n\nDate: Jul 23\n\n\n**\nCeltron\n**\nSubj: prkl!\n\nDate: Jul 30\n\nscrollscribblerssit oli aikamoinen abusereikkun pysty maxboosteilla pist鋗滗n blastin yhessrundissa sis滗n\nja siinsitten highbiet soolotti ekumonsuja.\ntunetin sitliteracyn kohtaa misscallataan offiresolvea. saattaa kaivata viellis鋞unea, jos joku innostuu viel6k boosteilla blastimaan.\n\n.. sit toinen juttu on toi psi:n instadeath speciaali. ei nyt muuten, mutta mitj鋜ke etteqmonsutkin tippuu siihen ??\npistin sinne levellimitin, ettsitei voi abusata ja muutenki tunesin niitstunnivehkeit ne n鋣tti aika j鋜kytt鋠ilt\n\nkannattais v鋒鋘 vakavammin ottaa ne testivaiheet, ettei p滗se tulemaan tommosia k鋗m鋣ksi\ngrr!\n\n**\nJarzki\n**\nSubj: test\n\nCc: **\nDate: Aug  9\n\nCritter Forest\n1.\nThis is the main entrance to critter forest.Strong voise is coming from\ndown.Maybe you should train yourself more powerful.\nNORTH 2\n\n2.\nYou are standing in a small rock what seems been quite often used.\nThe room is covered by liver looking staff.Bad smell is coming from\nwalls.\n謗kki\n謗kki\n謗kki\nSOUHT 1,WEST 15,EAST 3\n\n3.\nThe smell what smelled in the entrance is getting stronger.Its hard\nto breath.Bored looking guard is guarding the door leaving east.\nHe dont look happy.\n謗kki\nGuard\nWEST 2,NORHT 7,EAST 4\n\n**\nNeophyte\n**\nSubj: gl\n\nDate: Aug 26\n\n\n**\n"
